<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>SkillBridge — Skills, not just certificates</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="../css">
</head>
<body>

<header class="nav" id="siteNav">
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <a href="#top" class="logo">SkillBridge<span class="dot">.</span></a>

    <nav class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
      <a href="#personas">Portals</a>
      <a href="#pathway">Why SkillBridge</a>
      <a href="#how">How it works</a>
      <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
      <div class="nav-cta">
        <a href="#" class="btn btn-ghost">Log in</a>
        <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">Create account</a>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <button class="hamburger" id="hamburgerBtn" aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false">
      <span></span><span></span><span></span>
    </button>
  </div>
</header>

<main>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero" id="top">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">Smart India Hackathon &middot; Problem 44</p>
      <h1>Turn skills into opportunities, not just certificates.</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">SkillBridge connects students, academia and industry through honest skill assessment, real skill-gap mapping and verified profiles — so hiring stops running on guesswork.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <button class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" id="assessBtn">Assess my skills</button>
        <button class="btn btn-outline btn-lg" id="explorePortalsBtn">Explore the three portals</button>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-stats">
        <div><strong>3</strong><span>roles, one platform</span></div>
        <div><strong>Skills</strong><span>over certificates</span></div>
        <div><strong>Live</strong><span>industry-aligned data</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-visual" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 520 460" class="bridge-graph">
        <defs>
<linearGradient id="lineGrad" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1">
            <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#2563eb"/>
            <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#10b981"/>
          </linearGradient>
        </defs>

        <path class="graph-line" d="M110,110 C 200,180 220,220 260,230" />
        <path class="graph-line" d="M410,110 C 320,180 300,220 260,230" />
        <path class="graph-line" d="M110,350 C 200,280 220,250 260,230" />
        <path class="graph-line" d="M410,350 C 320,280 300,250 260,230" />

        <g class="node node-center">
          <circle cx="260" cy="230" r="46"/>
          <text x="260" y="225">SKILL</text>
          <text x="260" y="243">BRIDGE</text>
        </g>

        <g class="node node-role">
          <circle cx="110" cy="110" r="38"/>
          <text x="110" y="115">STUDENT</text>
        </g>
        <g class="node node-role">
          <circle cx="410" cy="110" r="38"/>
          <text x="410" y="115">INDUSTRY</text>
        </g>
        <g class="node node-role">
          <circle cx="110" cy="350" r="38"/>
          <text x="110" y="355">ACADEMIA</text>
        </g>
        <g class="node node-role">
          <circle cx="410" cy="350" r="38"/>
          <text x="410" y="355">MENTORS</text>
        </g>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PERSONA SWITCHER -->
  <section class="personas" id="personas">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>One platform. Three very different Monday mornings.</h2>
      <p>Tap a role to see what changes for them.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="persona-tabs" id="personaTabs" role="tablist">
      <button class="persona-tab active" data-role="student" role="tab" aria-selected="true">Student</button>
      <button class="persona-tab" data-role="academician" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Academician</button>
      <button class="persona-tab" data-role="industry" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Industry</button>
    </div>

    <div class="persona-panel">
      <div class="persona-image">
        <img id="personaImg" src="../images/student_split.png" alt="Split illustration showing a student's worries next to the SkillBridge solution">
  </div>

      <div class="persona-text">
        <h3 id="personaHeadline">Dream job. So many questions.</h3>

        <div class="persona-columns">
          <div>
            <h4>Right now</h4>
            <ul id="personaProblems"></ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4>With SkillBridge</h4>
            <ul id="personaSolutions"></ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- LIVE PORTAL -->
  <section class="live-portal" id="livePortal">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Connected workspace</p>
      <h2>See the platform working with live data.</h2>
      <p id="apiStatus" class="api-status">Connecting to SkillBridge...</p>
    </div>
    <div class="live-grid">
      <div class="live-card">
        <h3>Platform snapshot</h3>
        <div class="snapshot-grid">
          <div><strong id="studentCount">-</strong><span>students</span></div>
          <div><strong id="companyCount">-</strong><span>companies</span></div>
          <div><strong id="internshipCount">-</strong><span>opportunities</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="live-card auth-card">
        <h3>Student workspace</h3>
        <p id="authMessage">Log in to see recommendations and skill gaps.</p>
        <form id="loginForm" class="login-form">
          <input id="loginEmail" type="email" placeholder="Email" required>
          <input id="loginPassword" type="password" placeholder="Password" required>
          <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Log in</button>
        </form>
        <details class="register-details">
          <summary>Create a student account</summary>
          <form id="registerForm" class="register-form">
            <input id="registerName" placeholder="Full name" required>
            <input id="registerEmail" type="email" placeholder="Email" required>
            <input id="registerPassword" type="password" placeholder="Password" required>
            <input id="registerCollege" placeholder="College" required>
            <input id="registerCourse" placeholder="Course" required>
            <input id="registerYear" type="number" min="1" max="4" placeholder="Year" required>
            <input id="registerSkills" placeholder="Skills, comma separated">
            <button class="btn btn-outline" type="submit">Create account</button>
          </form>
        </details>
        <div id="studentData" class="student-data" hidden>
          <div><strong id="skillGapCount">0</strong><span>skill gaps</span></div>
          <button id="logoutBtn" class="btn btn-outline" type="button">Log out</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="live-card opportunities-card">
      <div class="opportunities-head">
        <div><h3>Open opportunities</h3><p>Live internships from the backend.</p></div>
        <button id="refreshOpportunities" class="btn btn-outline" type="button">Refresh</button>
      </div>
      <div id="opportunitiesList" class="opportunities-list"><p>Loading opportunities...</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PATHWAY -->
  <section class="pathway" id="pathway">
    <div class="section-head light">
      <p class="eyebrow">Old system isn't built for today</p>
      <h2>Prepare for a stronger tomorrow</h2>
      <p>Bridging the gap between academia, industry and students — because the future needs skilled, job-ready talent.</p>
    </div>
    <img class="pathway-img" src="../images/path-comparison.png" alt="Comparison of the traditional certificate-based path against the SkillBridge skill-first path">
  </section>

  <!-- FLOW -->
  <section class="flow" id="how">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>How a skill becomes an opportunity</h2>
      <p>The same pipeline runs underneath all three portals.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="flow-steps">
      <li><span class="flow-num">01</span><div><h4>Take the skill assessment</h4><p>Adaptive, role-aware, no certificates required to start.</p></div></li>
      <li><span class="flow-num">02</span><div><h4>Get your verified skill profile</h4><p>What you can actually do, laid out clearly.</p></div></li>
      <li><span class="flow-num">03</span><div><h4>See your skill gaps</h4><p>Matched against the role or requirement you're aiming for.</p></div></li>
      <li><span class="flow-num">04</span><div><h4>Follow a mapped learning path</h4><p>Training and mentorship built around the gap, not guesswork.</p></div></li>
      <li><span class="flow-num">05</span><div><h4>Match with real opportunities</h4><p>Internships, projects and jobs filtered by verified competency.</p></div></li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section class="faq" id="faq">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Questions people ask before joining</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-list" id="faqList">
<div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q">
          <span>What is SkillBridge, in one line?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a"><p>A platform that turns verified skills — not just certificates — into learning paths and career opportunities for students, academicians and industry.</p></div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q">
          <span>Is this only for engineering or CS students?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a"><p>No. Any student who wants their real skills recognised — across streams — can build a profile and take a role-based assessment.</p></div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q">
          <span>How does SkillBridge actually verify a skill?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a"><p>Through structured, role-based assessments and demonstrated project work, rather than relying on a certificate alone.</p></div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q">
          <span>What does an academician get out of this?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a"><p>Live visibility into the skills industry is actually hiring for, plus mentorship and training links to help align curriculum.</p></div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q">
          <span>How is this better than sorting resumes manually?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a"><p>Recruiters filter and match on verified skill data instead of reading hundreds of similar-looking resumes and certificates.</p></div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q">
          <span>Do I need existing projects or certificates to join?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a"><p>No. The assessment is the starting point — your skill profile and gap map are built from there.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

<footer class="footer">
  <div class="footer-inner">
    <div>
      <div class="logo">SkillBridge<span class="dot">.</span></div>
      <p class="footer-tag">Grow. Learn. Get hired.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-cols">
      <div>
        <h5>Platform</h5>
        <a href="#personas">Student portal</a>
        <a href="#personas">Academician portal</a>
        <a href="#personas">Industry portal</a>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h5>About</h5>
        <a href="#pathway">Why SkillBridge</a>
        <a href="#how">How it works</a>
        <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="footer-bottom">Built for Smart India Hackathon — Problem Statement 44, Academia&ndash;Industry Collaboration Portal.</p>
</footer>

<script src="../JavaScript"></script>
</body>
</html>